  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namubuka Maize Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Maize.Beneficiaries: 1,039 smallholder farmers..The project will provide funds for construction of standard stores in which to bulk farmers produce so that they can attract big buyers like World Food Programme. The project will also provide working capital to enable the Cooperative pay farmers cash on delivery to facilitate bulking and also avoid side selling. In addition, the project will provide processing equipment for adding value to the farmers produce.</narrative>
  </description>
